# otacon atlas manifest
# atlas <width> <height> <sourceCanvasW> <sourceCanvasH>
# region <name> <x> <y> <w> <h> <offsetX> <offsetY>
#
# offsetX/offsetY are where the trim removed from, so a sprite drawn at
# (pos + offset) sits exactly where it did on the original canvas --
# which is what preserves this pack's shared anchor.
